  "id": "pre-op-psychological-assessment-record",
  "name": "Pre-Op Psychological Assessment Record",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Pre-Op_Psychological_Assessment_Record",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-15T09:07:35.239Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Psychological consultation for members experiencing pre-op anxiety. The session has been archived per standard protocol. (Patient information has been anonymized for confidentiality.)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The consultation record is as follows:"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8b7af50bf9a56c3f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fulwish:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Praise the Master of Elation! Is everyone having a"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "happy"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "day today?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b0210ca75695998e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Member A:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I... I'm so happy. (uneasy, restless)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0ff7afc97b7aec76"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fulwish:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No, you're not"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "happy"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ". If you were, you wouldn't be here right now. Today I'm not speaking as the president of the Smiles Society. Think of me as just a normal friend, someone you can open up to about what's troubling you."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-12e6a21fb44848ae"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Member A:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lady... Fulwish... I'll admit, if it weren't for everyone at the Smiles Society, on the day I got laid off, I probably would've... But with your encouragement, I found a new job and even gained a new family. I think I should give it one more shot and try to find happiness through my own strength, instead of jumping straight into the surgery."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-56c02dcfb8b3b423"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fulwish:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're absolutely right. The Society isn't the IPC. We'd never force our members to do anything. Today's just a friendly chat between friends, so relax. Let's just talk about life, shall we?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-41cde94c4a4db148"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How's work been lately? Getting along with your coworkers? Is everyone"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "happy"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-57474ca2f9be5893"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Member A:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...Yeah, everyone's so happy, bursting with energy every single day, and it's all thanks to your help. But sometimes, I feel like we're from two different worlds. Whenever I'm exhausted and just want to sigh, I take one look at them and... it's like I'm doing something I'm not allowed to do."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a65c316a06ae60be"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fulwish:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I went through the same thing in the days right after the Bloodstained Games ended. Everyone was so kind, but the more help I accepted, the guiltier I felt. I was scared that if they saw even a hint of unease on my face, it would hurt them too. I was scared that if I cried, it would make them sad."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-32a822fa94e520ba"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But that only made me lonelier, made me think that"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "misfortune itself was a kind of original sin"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3f001cc15755f85d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Member A:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yeah, I totally get that! It's like this vibe hanging over all of Planarcadia. Whether it's at the company, out on the streets, or online... seeing everyone laughing and having a blast always makes me feel like I should join in, but..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a5850ad3edd0385c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fulwish:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't blame yourself. Pursuing"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "happiness"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "is human nature. It's precisely because you aren't happy enough that you yearn for that"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "world of happiness"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", and you've mistaken that yearning for alienation."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b56b711fa47f8162"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Picture this: everyone around you is laughing, but you're the only one in tears. Your wife and kids are happily chatting away nearby, while all you can do is heave a heavy sigh. Do you really want to turn your back on them? Or would you rather bask in that atmosphere of"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "happiness"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", stand by their side, and share a laugh?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-706c7eaf50588cf9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Happiness is a divine gift, not something to be ashamed of. When it comes down to it, do you truly resist the"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Surgery"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "? You simply haven't recognized your true self yet. Tell me, what is it you really want?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d88f06fdbd2f5c27"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Member A:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I want to... join them. I want to be happy."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5b080a2cb497b422"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
